  "description": "Far from home and full of determination, a tiny frog sets off on the adventure of a lifetime. Explore a vibrant, storybook world brimming with secrets — from sun-dappled forests and cobblestone town squares to the towering halls of a grand castle, patrolled by a not-so-friendly giant guard.\n\nHop, leap, and bounce your way through charming levels as you hunt down three legendary Power Gems, the only things that can carry you back where you belong. Collect hundreds of scattered coins, outwit quirky enemies, and uncover every corner of a lovingly crafted kingdom.\n\nAnd when the adventure gets a little too adventurous? Hit pause and treat yourself — and your frog — to a well-earned dance break.",
